{"4928760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scrapman Simulator", "steam_appid": 4928760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📦 Build a Life from the Streets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey, starting with a few pieces of cardboard you gather from the streets, can turn into the city's largest recycling enterprise. Roam the neighborhoods, explore abandoned areas, and collect cardboard, metal, iron, copper, and other recyclable materials in front of markets and shops. Carry them to your cart, sell them, and grow your business with the money you earn. Transform from a small street scrapper into a powerful businessman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>♻️ Collect, Recycle, Earn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different neighborhoods of the city and collect recyclable materials. Although cardboard is your biggest source of income, increase your earnings by finding metal, iron, copper, and other valuable scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛒 Upgrade Your Cart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cardboard collection vehicle to carry more load. Start the job with a handcart... Increase your carrying capacity, buy faster vehicles, and multiply your earnings by collecting more scrap in less time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏠 Improve Your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just keep the money you earn in your pocket. Upgrade the house you live in, create a more comfortable living space, and meet your daily needs. Listen to the sound of the street. Buy different food and drinks, maintain your energy, and get ready for the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📈 Start Small, Think Big</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about collecting cardboard. Manage your money right, improve your business, make new investments, and establish the city's largest cardboard recycling company. Success depends entirely on your management skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌆 A City Inspired by Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every region is the same. While wandering through the city inspired by the spirit of Istanbul, new opportunities await you at every corner. Explore different regions, find more valuable scrap, and create your own working route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Game Features 🎮</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 First-person (FPS) gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 You can play together with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍞 Food and basic needs shopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Home improvement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♻️ Realistic cardboard collection and recycling system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Economy and money management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Free roam and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Continuous progress and upgrade system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ Relaxing, immersive life simulation</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📦 Build a Life from the Streets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey, starting with a few pieces of cardboard you gather from the streets, can turn into the city's largest recycling enterprise. Roam the neighborhoods, explore abandoned areas, and collect cardboard, metal, iron, copper, and other recyclable materials in front of markets and shops. Carry them to your cart, sell them, and grow your business with the money you earn. Transform from a small street scrapper into a powerful businessman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>♻️ Collect, Recycle, Earn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different neighborhoods of the city and collect recyclable materials. Although cardboard is your biggest source of income, increase your earnings by finding metal, iron, copper, and other valuable scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛒 Upgrade Your Cart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cardboard collection vehicle to carry more load. Start the job with a handcart... Increase your carrying capacity, buy faster vehicles, and multiply your earnings by collecting more scrap in less time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏠 Improve Your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just keep the money you earn in your pocket. Upgrade the house you live in, create a more comfortable living space, and meet your daily needs. Listen to the sound of the street. Buy different food and drinks, maintain your energy, and get ready for the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📈 Start Small, Think Big</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just about collecting cardboard. Manage your money right, improve your business, make new investments, and establish the city's largest cardboard recycling company. Success depends entirely on your management skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌆 A City Inspired by Istanbul</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every region is the same. While wandering through the city inspired by the spirit of Istanbul, new opportunities await you at every corner. Explore different regions, find more valuable scrap, and create your own working route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Game Features 🎮</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 First-person (FPS) gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 You can play together with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍞 Food and basic needs shopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Home improvement system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >♻️ Realistic cardboard collection and recycling system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Economy and money management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Free roam and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Continuous progress and upgrade system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❤️ Relaxing, immersive life simulation</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Start by collecting cardboard from the streets, turn scrap metal into cash, upgrade your home and vehicle, and grow your business. Build your own recycling empire by playing solo or with your friends in a living city inspired by Istanbul.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Azerbaijani, Filipino, Hindi, Croatian, Kazakh", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928760/7f4f941186ba59df334a2b9718e13585ddf56cec/header.jpg?t=1785108024", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928760/849d428b9f1db56e04365629e76a9ef0d10db74c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785108024", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928760/849d428b9f1db56e04365629e76a9ef0d10db74c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785108024", "website": "http://www.analizgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bits Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K@3.3GHz or AMD FX 6300@3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 780 or AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</s